@title Hamtaro - Ham-Ham Heartbreak (USA)
@file Hamtaro - Ham-Ham Heartbreak (U).gba
@game AH3E
@chip SRAM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: no save reached. START / SELECT / B open nothing in the opening, and the SRAM written by then (2180 bytes, identical on all three) is not a game: the title still offers only "New". The first save is past Boss's Ham-Chat tutorial on the clubhouse stage, not reached.

# New game with the default names (Hamtaro / Bijou), A through the Spat
# intro and the clubhouse wake-up, walk down to the main room (cutscene),
# then the stage room where Boss teaches Ham-Chats: R opens the list,
# Hamha / Tack-Q on the sunflower seed.
# Small differences: the title and intro animations are a frame apart
# between the emulators (title f600/f720: dingbat-bios differs from mgba ==
# nba at f720); menus and gameplay screens are identical.
[new]
wait 600
wait 120
checkpoint title window=30 compare=text
press START
wait 120
checkpoint new_menu window=30
press A
wait 180
checkpoint names window=30
press DOWN after=15
press DOWN after=15
press A
wait 180
press START after=20
press A
wait 120
press DOWN after=20
press A
wait 180
